		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Rolling holy shrine, crushing weaker beings under its massive brass wheels.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 14, <strong>HP</strong> 40, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 slam +6 (2d6) or 1 charge, <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> +0, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> -3, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> -3, <strong>AL</strong> *, <strong>LV</strong> 8</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Alignment</strong>. Always dedicated to a deity. If unknown roll d6: 1-2. Lawful, 3-4. Neutral. 5-6. Chaotic</p><p></p><p><strong>Bound</strong>. Cannot attack or hinder a creature wearing the deity's holy symbol.</p><p></p><p><strong>Charge</strong>. In place of attacks, move up to double near in a straight line and make 1 slam attack. If hit, x3 damage.</p><p></p><p><strong>Construct</strong>. Only damaged by adamantine or magical sources.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
